# A nested ignore file cannot name its parent: shells/out/ (every artifact) is ignored by the ROOT .gitignore.
node_modules/

# ios/ is Capacitor's generated Xcode project. Its TEXT is this shell's source – reproducible with
# `cap add ios` + `cap sync` and reviewable in a diff. What `cap sync` copies in, and what Xcode and
# CocoaPods produce, is not, and stays out:
#
# the synced web app: a COPY of dist/ with the bridge injected by build.mjs, regenerated every run.
# The bridge's own source lives in bridge/ and is committed.
App/public/
Pods/
build/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
# SwiftPM's local build state, should the project resolve packages in-tree
.build/
.swiftpm/
